- 0041: Modules.load sets m.tiled and deinit undefines the struct again, and attendLastRow launches one row and takes the whole chunk's prompt flag
- 0057: the DECODE scale is broadcast across the warp, with the reset check beside it

Re-seated on v1.2.7 (93a2e93ecebff8aa52b88e58c5dd222516e69c5f, from pin 9c9bf542) by the 2026-11-12 re-seat (work/reseat/DECISIONS.md):
- lean_check.py's DIRECT_GETENV/HIDDEN_GETENV: every TF_* setting this patch reads is a row of platform/environment.zig with a line in docs/environment.md, read through cuda.ovn or environment, never getenv. Rows: TF_GLM_OVN_ONEPASS_PIPE, _ABSORB_VEC, _KVB8 (flags), _MLA_FUSEMERGE (u64); cuda_glue.Mla arrives here whole (fold-series.md J20).
